    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">Sam is playing with <var>n</var> cards that has a positive integer <var>A_i</var> (<const>1</const> &le; <var>i</var> &le; <var>n</var>) assigned on it.<br><br>He can create a new number by appending those integers one after another. Sam wants to know the largest number that he can create. Since Sam doesn't know how to solve this problem, he asks you for help.<br><br>Example Explanation:<br>Given <const>5</const> cards, <const>123</const> <const>124</const> <const>56</const> <const>90</const> <const>9</const>.<br><br>After a bit of shuffling, you will find that rearraging the cards as <const>9</const> <const>90</const> <const>56</const> <const>124</const> <const>123</const> then appending all of them to attain <const>99056124123</const> is the largest possible integer.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> <var>n</var>, denoting the number of cards Sam has.<br><strong>Line 2:</strong> <var>A1</var> <var>A2</var> ... <var>An</var>, denoting the positive integer assigned on the <var>i</var>-th card, separated by space.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\">Output a single integer on a line by itself indicating the largest possible integer which can be made by appending the <var>n</var> integers.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\"><const>1</const> &le; <var>n</var> &le; <const>50</const><br><const>1</const> &le; <var>Ai</var> &le; <const>10^15</const></div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">5\n123 124 56 90 9</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">99056124123\n</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
